      "Language": "rus",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Proof of clinical equivalence of generic and original dugs - the way to lessen cost of therapy of patients while providing comparable clinical effects. We present in this paper results of 1 year follow-up of 115 patients receiving Egithromb or Plavics after coronary artery stenting. Comparable clinical efficacy and safety of Egithromb and Plavics has been established."},
